Hear me out for a bit.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <JapaneseText>いいね、それ
やろう、&lt;Loni&gt;！</JapaneseText>
