      <EnglishText>Wah!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kyle&gt;！
あんたって子は････!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Kyle!
You naughty little...!!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････&lt;Loni&gt;!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...&lt;Loni&gt;?!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <JapaneseText>へへへ････
ただいま、ルーティさん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Heh heh heh...
I'm back, Rutee.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <JapaneseText>もう、ったくあんたって子は！
アタモニ神団に入ってからこっち
手紙のひとつもよこさないで････！
心配したでしょ、このバカっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh honestly, you naughty boy!
You haven't sent us a single
letter since you went off to
join the Church of Atamoni and...!
{02}I was worried sick, you idiot!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ちょ、ちょっと待った、ルーティさん！
ぐ、苦じい････！
がああぁぁッ････!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>W, wait just a minute,
Rutee! I-I can't breaze...!
Gwaaaaahhh...!!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <JapaneseText>良い天気だ
眠くなってきちゃったよ････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's a beautiful day.
I'm getting sleepy.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>50</Id>
      <JapaneseText>うう････このフトンにくるまって
眠りたい････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ugh...I want to sleep
wrapped up in this futon...</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>51</Id>
      <JapaneseText>いってらっしゃいませ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Have a good day.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
